# /support is the URL given to App Store Connect as the Support URL, and a
# support URL that 404s is a cited guideline 2.1 rejection. Static hosting
# usually serves support.html at /support on its own, but "usually" is not a
# thing to bet a review round on, so this states it.
#
# 200 rather than 301: serve the file at that path, no redirect hop.
/support    /support.html    200
